# FastAPI/Streamlit Decoupling — Walkthrough

## Summary

Decoupled the monolithic Streamlit app into a **FastAPI backend** (port 8000) that owns all LangGraph execution, Postgres checkpointing, Docker sandbox, and telemetry, and a **Streamlit frontend** (port 8501) that is a pure HTTP client rendering the same Pro IDE layout.

**3 files created, 4 files modified, 0 backend modules changed.**

