### [server.py](file:///c:/Users/Harsh%20Sharma/OneDrive/Desktop/Devin/src/api/server.py)
FastAPI application with:

| Endpoint | Method | Purpose |
|----------|--------|---------|
| `/api/v1/health` | GET | Postgres status, API key checks, psutil telemetry |
| `/api/v1/session/new` | POST | Generate backend-authoritative thread IDs |
| `/api/v1/execute` | POST | SSE-streaming LangGraph execution |

**SSE Protocol**: The `/execute` endpoint streams three event types:
- `node_update` — After each graph node completes: transition label, new pipeline logs, terminal output delta, workspace_files, active_file, code_buffer, telemetry snapshot
- `complete` — Final accumulated state with all fields
- `error` — Exception details with phase identification

**Lifecycle**: Uses FastAPI lifespan to eagerly compile the LangGraph app on startup and cleanup the Postgres connection pool on shutdown.

